1
00:00:03,203 --> 00:00:05,267
A formula can give a label.

2
00:00:05,267 --> 00:00:10,957
This one answers Long when the talk time is ten minutes or more, and Short otherwise.

3
00:00:10,957 --> 00:00:12,583
Text goes in quotes.

4
00:00:18,650 --> 00:00:20,629
A formula can fill a gap.

5
00:00:20,629 --> 00:00:25,990
COALESCE gives the queue name, or Outbound campaigns when a call has no queue.

6
00:00:35,699 --> 00:00:38,127
And a formula can work with dates.

7
00:00:38,127 --> 00:00:41,406
DATEDIFF counts the days from the call to today.

8
00:00:41,406 --> 00:00:46,809
The Functions list explains every function, and a click writes it into the formula.

